_name,\nl.mode,\nl.granted\nFROM pg_locks l\nJOIN pg_class c ON l.relation = c.oid\nWHERE c.relname = 'tab_nontxn_db_2_56fed44f'\nAND l.granted = true;\n```\nSession 2 query should return the below but it is  not returning anything now\n\n ```\n       table_name        |      mode       | granted \n--------------------------+-----------------+---------\n tab_nontxn_db_2_56fed44f | AccessShareLock | t\n(1 row)\n```\n\n\n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [x] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-17809]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-17809?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"yusong-yan","id":46516278,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTE2Mjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46516278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan","html_url":"https://github.com/yusong-yan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusong-yan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/iss